    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "鎌倉",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-6:caption",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "紅芋そふとくりぃむ、美味しかったでにゃんすね。\n今も口の中に幸せがほわっと広がってるでにゃんす♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "鎌倉にはいろんなグルメがあるねぇ。\n焼きたてのお煎餅も、すごくおいしかったよ♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "二人とも、そんなにはしゃいで……。\n私たちは遊びに来たわけではないのですよ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "男極『シンクロ部門』では、視聴者の方が送って\n下さった思い出の手紙を元に作られた曲を歌います。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "人々の心に寄り添ったステージを届けられるのか、\nその力を示さなくてはならないのです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "彩が担当することになったのは、その手紙ですね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はい。こちらに書かれている『ササリンドウ』や\n『カイドウ』から推しはかるに、",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "送り主が住んでいたのは、おそらく鎌倉でしょう。\nササリンドウは鎌倉市の市章なんですよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "この手紙は鎌倉を離れた送り主が、\n故郷の友人に宛てたもののようです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "鎌倉を回って手紙の想いをくみ取り、\n当日の歌番組で見事に歌い切りましょう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "次の男極『シンクロ部門』で勝つのは、彩です！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "清澄 九郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もちろんでにゃんす～！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "猫柳 キリオ"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_05_a:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_05_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_05_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "当然そのつもりだけどサ。\n……ちょっと気になることがあるわよねぇ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "華村 翔真"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
